<section id="licenses" class="wrap section-block">
  <div class="section-top"><h2>Licenses</h2>
    <p class="normal">Every product is available under one or more tiers, from fully open to internal-use-only proprietary. Licensing is negotiated around the software, deployment model, scope, and ownership requirements of each project.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="license-ladder">
    <div class="ladder-tier">
      <span class="badge badge--license badge-val-open-source-apache-2-0">Open Source (Apache 2.0)</span>
      <p class="muted" style="margin:0">Free to use, modify, and distribute — including in commercial products — with attribution.</p>
      <div class="chip-row"><span class="chip chip--primary">Extropian Core</span><span class="chip chip--primary">Extropian Geometry</span><span class="chip chip--primary">Extropian CAE</span><span class="chip chip--primary">Extropian Optimization</span><span class="chip chip--primary">Extropian Assets</span></div>
    </div>
    <div class="ladder-arrow">&#8595;</div>
    <div class="ladder-tier">
      <span class="badge badge--license badge-val-source-available-polyform-shield">Source Available (PolyForm Shield)</span>
      <p class="muted" style="margin:0">View and build from the source under terms that prevent offering it as a competing product or service — no license fees or royalties.</p>
      <div class="chip-row"><span class="chip chip--primary">Extropian CAE Workbench</span><span class="chip chip--primary">Extropian Render</span></div>
    </div>
    <div class="ladder-arrow">&#8595;</div>
    <div class="ladder-tier">
      <span class="badge badge--license badge-val-binary-distribution-proprietary">Binary Distribution (Proprietary)</span>
      <p class="muted" style="margin:0">One-time license to use and distribute the software in binary form, including inside products you sell.</p>
      <div class="chip-row"><span class="chip chip--primary">Extropian CAE Workbench</span><span class="chip chip--primary">Extropian Render</span><span class="chip chip--primary">Extropian Synthesis</span><span class="chip chip--primary">Extropian Spatial UI</span><span class="chip chip--primary">Extropian Composer</span><span class="chip chip--primary">Extropian Viz</span><span class="chip chip--primary">Extropian Physics</span></div>
    </div>
    <div class="ladder-arrow">&#8595;</div>
    <div class="ladder-tier">
      <span class="badge badge--license badge-val-internal-use-proprietary">Internal Use (Proprietary)</span>
      <p class="muted" style="margin:0">One-time license for ongoing internal use of the software as delivered — no distribution, no recurring fees.</p>
      <div class="chip-row"><span class="chip chip--primary">Extropian CAE Workbench</span><span class="chip chip--primary">Extropian Render</span><span class="chip chip--primary">Extropian Synthesis</span><span class="chip chip--primary">Extropian Spatial UI</span><span class="chip chip--primary">Extropian Composer</span><span class="chip chip--primary">Extropian Viz</span><span class="chip chip--primary">Extropian Physics</span></div>
    </div>
  </div>

