<section id="custom-dev" class="wrap section-block">
  <div class="section-top"><h2>Custom development engagements</h2>
    <p class="normal">Beyond the products: I extend them or develop additional components as part of the engagement. Every engagement starts with a free 15-minute fit call.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="card-grid">
    <div class="info-card"><h3>Technical Assessment</h3><p class="muted">A fixed-scope paid audit of your existing system: findings, risks, options, estimated impact, and recommended next steps &mdash; not just a conversation.</p></div>
    <div class="info-card"><h3>Fixed-Scope Sprint</h3><p class="muted">Time-boxed engagements to upgrade, optimize, fix critical bugs, or build something new &mdash; budgeted as a fixed price based on value.</p></div>
    <div class="info-card"><h3>Embedded Specialist</h3><p class="muted">Short- to medium-term integration with your team as a hands-on contributor &mdash; simulation, GPU compute, visualization, or legacy modernization.</p></div>
    <div class="info-card"><h3>Ongoing Stewardship</h3><p class="muted">Lightweight retainers for continued architectural or maintenance oversight without full-time involvement &mdash; often running for years.</p></div>
    <div class="info-card"><h3>Strategic Partnership</h3><p class="muted">In limited cases, B2B partnerships or shared-IP arrangements where the problem is well-defined, high-impact, and aligns with simulation and scientific computing.</p></div>
  </div>
</section>

